	(text "Power Supply calculations, normal is peak, () is continuos\n1) MCP2518FD - 20mA @ 3V3; \n2) MCP2558FD - 140mA @ 5V; (5mA @ 5V)\n			 - 0.4mA @ 3V3; (0.03mA @ 3V3)\n3) ADPL42005 - 1.4mA @ 5V\n4) 74AHCTG125 - 1.5mA @ 5V\n5) RPI Zero 2W - 1000mA @ 5V; (700mA)\n6) Display    - 850mA @ 5V; (900mA)\n7) LED Strip (12) - 720mA @ 5V; (450 mA) at 47% brightness\n\n\nMax actual current : 2745.4mA\n\nMax current with FoS of 1.3 : 3569.02 => 3,600mA"
